flowchart TD
    title Shopping Cart Flow

    A[View Cart] --> B[Load Cart Items]
    B --> C[Calculate Subtotal]
    C --> D[Apply Coupons]
    D --> E[Calculate Tax]
    E --> F[Calculate Shipping]
    F --> G[Show Cart Total]

    G --> H{User Action?}
    H -->|Update Qty| I[Validate Stock]
    I -->|In Stock| J[Update Cart Item]
    I -->|Out of Stock| K[Show Error]
    J --> G
    K --> G

    H -->|Remove Item| L[Remove from Cart]
    L --> G

    H -->|Add Coupon| M[Validate Coupon]
    M -->|Valid| N[Apply Discount]
    M -->|Invalid| O[Show Error]
    N --> G
    O --> G

    H -->|Checkout| P{Cart Empty?}
    P -->|Yes| Q[Show "Cart is Empty"]
    P -->|No| R[Proceed to Checkout]
